It would seem that you are claiming this.

Magnificent evidence for the power of operational definitions.

Operational definitions clarify things in some areas.  In other 
areas, such as this one, they bamboozle people.

Operationalism is a useful tool in many areas, but to claim
it as a definition of language and reality is utter
nonsense.

I cannot see why Price is always flaming me.  I am a
