denominated in thorns.  The sale or attempted sale of keybording
services.  Thorn bets.  Bids to buy certain products.  Suppose this
trend continues.  Rowan is selling thorns for dollars.  If services are
offered denominated in thorns, someone(s) will start buying thorns for
dollars.

